  "text": "Haven Lake Animal Hospital - Milford, DE - Home\nMenu\nHome\nServices\nWellness Care\nCancer Care\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEnd of Life Care\nSurgery\nEchocardiograms\nEchocardiogram Form For Clients\nExotics\nAmphibian form\nAvian History Form\nReptile History Form\nSmall Mammal History Form\nI-131 Therapy\nResources\nPet Library\nPharmacy\nLinks\nPromotions\nAbout Us\nVeterinarians & Staff\nLeave a Review\nHospital Tour\nForms\nClient Information Form\nReferral Form\nRequest Appointment\nRx Refill\nI-131 Treatment Overview\nDental Release\nSurgical Release\nContact Us\nEmergencies\nOnline Store\n300 Milford Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\n(302) 422-8100\nHome\nServices\nWellness Care\nCancer Care\nDentistry\nDiagnostic Services\nEnd of Life Care\nSurgery\nEchocardiograms\nEchocardiogram Form For Clients\nExotics\nAmphibian form\nAvian History Form\nReptile History Form\nSmall Mammal History Form\nI-131 Therapy\nResources\nPet Library\nPharmacy\nLinks\nPromotions\nAbout Us\nVeterinarians & Staff\nLeave a Review\nHospital Tour\nForms\nClient Information Form\nReferral Form\nRequest Appointment\nRx Refill\nI-131 Treatment Overview\nDental Release\nSurgical Release\nContact Us\nEmergencies\nOnline Store\nHome\nProcessing ....\nHaven Lake Animal Hospital\n300 Milford Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\n(302)422-8100\nwww.havenlakeanimalhospital.com\nSERVICE YOU EXPECT... AND MORE!\nHav\nen Lake An\nim\nal H\nosp\nital is everything you’d expect in a veterinary clinic and more\n.\nWe happen to do it all, conveniently located in Milford, DE. We offer quality medicine and compassionate care, of course. But we don’t stop there. At our hospital we also provide many unique services that you may not expect to find in a general veterinary practice.\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, you have access to cutting edge pet care including\nI–131 for feline thyroid cancer\n,\nadvanced dental care\n,\nechocardiograms\n,\nand\nexotic\nanimal\nwellness care\n.\nWe are always striving to keep our services and technology current and ahead of the the needs of our community. Our practice is always open to adding new patients and new pet families to our Haven Lake Animal Hospital community. We are here to serve you!\nPeople from all over the Delmarva peninsula have been trusting our veterinarians since 1999. We encourage you to contact us today, so you can do the same!\nOnline Pharmacy\nHaven Lake Animal Hospital is happy to offer Covetrus, a convenient online pharmacy for all your pets medication needs.\nCovetrus\nensures pet owners benefit from our comprehensive pharmaceutical services and home delivery of leading pet care products.\nCovetrus\nhome delivery, the easy-to-use service that saves you time by delivering all your pet's needs right to your door.\nDownload the PetPage App\nAccess our mobile version by clicking on the appropriate app store button below.\nAccess Your PetPage Online\nPetPage is an easy-to-use, digital self-serve Patient Portal that keeps you connected to your pet's health.\nI-131 Therapy for Cats\nGet Your Pet Food Delivered Directly From The Source!\nHill's to\nHome\nPurina Vet Direct\nTake advantage of this opportunity for potential savings on pet food.\nClick on the Hill's or Purina name to access customer portals.\nI would not take my fur babies any where else. They are loving, compassionate, friendly and most of all understanding. We love seeing Ms. Edna just chilling. Doc Frances knows all our babies and and cares deeply for each one. - Berhrens Family\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, we understand that you may feel a bit overwhelmed by it all, but rest assured that we are here to help and guide you and your pet through the process and back to health. If your pet has not recently been in for an annual wellness exam or dental exam, is not current on his or her vaccinations, or has any other issues you are concerned about, please\ncontact us\nto schedule an appointment.\nAt Haven Lake Animal Hospital, we understand that you may feel a bit overwhelmed by it all, but rest assured that we are here to help and guide you and your pet through the process and back to health. If your pet has not recently been in for an annual wellness exam or dental exam, is not current on his or her vaccinations, or has any other issues you are concerned about, please\ncontact us\nto schedule an appointment.\nWays to Connect:\nUse our\nonline forms\nto request an appointment, refill medication, or to pre-check in for procedures.\nSend a text to (302)422-8100 to check in for appointments or to ask a question.\nSend us an\nemail\nwith any question or concern.\nWe are here for you!\nContact Details\n300 Milford-Harrington Highway\nMilford, DE 19963\nTel:\n(302) 422-8100\nFax:\n(302) 422-6490\nEmail\n:\ninfo@havenlakeanimalhospital.com\nHospital Hours\nMon: 8:00am-6:00pm\nTue: 7:30am-6:00pm\nWed: 7:30am-6:00pm\nThur: 7:30am-6:00pm\nFri: 7:30 am-4:00pm\nSat: 8:00am-1:00pm\nSun: Closed\nBrought to you by\neVetSites®\nInspired by the VIN community, part of the VIN family",
